window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>\"I know it's wrong to watch her like this, but she's a temptation I can't resist. She's performing for another man, but I feel like it's all for me. Like she's mine.\"</p> <p>Nine lives.</p> <p>Nine inches.</p> <p>One chance to make her his.</p> <p>Preppy's brother is about to live up to the family legacy in more ways than one.</p> <p>This is the story of Nine, the tale of Kevin Clearwater.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
